  "shortDescription": "AliDrop automates importing and fulfilling products from AliExpress, Alibaba, and Temu into Shopify and other storefronts — a sourcing layer, not a standalone store. Plans (2026-08-18): Starter $39/mo (50 unique / 25 premium products), Professional $59/mo (500 / 250), Empire $99/mo (5,000 / 2,500), Unicorn $299/mo (25,000 / 25,000). $1 for 7-day trial; annual discounts published. 0% AliDrop transaction fee on subscriptions.",
